        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sinngedichte, Op. 1\n- People: Johann Strauss II\n- Places: Vienna, Dommayer's Casino\n- Concepts: waltz, \"The Waltz King\"\n\nFacts:\n- Sinngedichte, Op. 1, is a waltz.\n- In 1844, Johann Strauss II composed Sinngedichte, Op. 1, for his debut as a composer at Dommayer's Casino in Vienna.\n- During his lifetime, Johann Strauss II was known as \"The Waltz King\".\n- In the 19th century, Johann Strauss II was largely responsible for the popularity of the waltz in Vienna.",
